source	Thomas Aquinas, Summa Theologica I q.14 a.13 obj. 3, tr. Fathers of the English Dominican Province
text	Project Gutenberg ebook 17611, https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/17611
class	scope
word	must necessarily be
fault	"everything known by God must necessarily be" is true of the saying (necessarily, what God knows is so) and false of the thing (what God knows is itself necessary); the conclusion needs the second
reference	Aquinas, ST I q.14 a.13 ad 3 (the composite and the divided sense)
known	canon
